    title: 'Burnham links ending the Iran war to UK cost-of-living relief',
    slug: 'burnham-iran-war-cost-of-living',
    excerpt:
      'At a Commonwealth summit, the PM argued Middle East de-escalation and a reopened Strait of Hormuz are household economics, not only geopolitics.',
    photo: 'photo-1611974789855-9c2a0a7236a3',
    alt: 'Market charts illustrating economic pressure',
