    slug: 'eu-uk-university-tuition-fees-trade-negotiations-2026',
    excerpt:
      'European officials are seeking a UK commitment on university tuition fees as negotiations continue over trade, youth exchanges and closer post-Brexit relations.',
    localFile: 'public/articles/eu-uk-university-fees.jpg',
